This project depends on, but does not redistribute, the following:

  - Terraform and the HashiCorp AWS and Archive providers
    (https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform, MPL-2.0 / BUSL-1.1 depending on
    version; providers are MPL-2.0)
  - boto3, available in the AWS Lambda Python runtime
    (https://github.com/boto/boto3, Apache-2.0)

Neither is vendored into this repository. Terraform downloads providers at
init time and Lambda supplies boto3 at runtime.
